# PROJECT SYNOPSIS

## 1. Title of the Project

**Vanguard Gaming Store – Online Gaming Store Website**

## 2. Introduction

The **Vanguard Gaming Store** is a frontend web application designed to provide users with a modern, interactive, and visually appealing platform for exploring video games. The website will display various games along with their prices, ratings, genres, descriptions, and offers.

The project will be developed using **HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript**. It will include interactive frontend features such as game search, category filtering, shopping cart management, wishlist, dark/light mode, and browser-based Local Storage.

The main purpose of this project is to demonstrate practical knowledge of frontend web development while creating a website that resembles a real-world online gaming marketplace.

## 3. Problem Statement

Many basic gaming websites are either static or provide limited interaction to users. A modern gaming store should provide an attractive interface along with convenient features for discovering and managing games.

The proposed **Vanguard Gaming Store** aims to provide users with an interactive interface where they can:

* Browse available games
* Search for specific games
* Filter games by category
* View game information
* Add games to a shopping cart
* Manage their wishlist
* Calculate the total purchase amount

The project will focus entirely on the **frontend**, without requiring a backend or database.

## 4. Objectives

The main objectives of the project are:

1. To develop a modern and attractive gaming store website.
2. To create a responsive interface for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.
3. To implement game searching and category filtering using JavaScript.
4. To implement shopping cart functionality.
5. To display game information such as price, genre, rating, and description.
6. To implement Dark/Light mode.
7. To use Local Storage for maintaining cart and wishlist information.
8. To gain practical experience in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, DOM manipulation, and responsive web design.

## 5. Proposed Features

### 5.1 Home Page

The home page will contain:

* Gaming-themed hero section
* Featured games
* Trending games
* Special offers
* Navigation to the game store

### 5.2 Game Store

The game store will display:

* Game images
* Game names
* Prices
* Ratings
* Genres
* Discount information
* Add to Cart and Wishlist options

### 5.3 Search and Filtering

Users will be able to search games by name and filter them according to categories such as:

* Action
* Adventure
* RPG
* Racing
* Sports
* Strategy

### 5.4 Game Details

The game details section will provide:

* Game description
* Genre
* Rating
* Price
* Discount
* System requirements
* Add to Cart option

### 5.5 Shopping Cart

The shopping cart will allow users to:

* Add games
* Remove games
* Change quantity
* View subtotal
* Calculate total amount

### 5.6 Wishlist

Users will be able to save their preferred games to a wishlist for future reference.

### 5.7 Dark/Light Mode

A theme-switching feature will allow users to switch between dark and light modes for a better browsing experience.

### 5.8 Local Storage

JavaScript Local Storage will be used to save cart and wishlist information in the user's browser so that the information can remain available after refreshing the webpage.

